						<span class="alignright comment-upvote"><a href="/walden/" class="comment_upvoter upvote" data-do="upvote" data-comment_id="5" title="Like">Like (<span class="upvotes">4</span>)</a></span>
						<cite class="fn"><a href="https://commons.digitalthoreau.org/members/walterharding/">Walter Harding (1917-1996)</a></cite>
						<a class="comment_permalink" href="https://commons.digitalthoreau.org/walden/#comment-5" title="Permalink for this comment"><span class="comment_permalink_copy"></span>January 3, 2014 at 5:22 pm</a>
